  "doc_hash_rule": "SHA-256 of the UTF-8 of stage_key(maze.stage.json) (rows, then 'zone <id> <room|corridor> <height cm>' per zone, joined by newlines), first 16 lowercase hex chars; node name DOCHASH_<hash> (modeling/stagehash.py = src/StageModel.flix docHashOf)",
